graph TD
    A[PolyA Signal] --> B[CPSF Binding]
    B --> C[PolyA Site Recognition]
    C --> D[Cleavage Factor Binding]
    D --> E[Pre-mRNA Cleavage]
    E --> F[PolyA Polymerase]
    F --> G[PolyA Tail Synthesis]
    G --> H[PolyA Tail Extension]
    H --> I[PolyA Tail Maturation]
    I --> J[Polyadenylation Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> K[Alternative PolyA Site]
    K --> L[Alternative Cleavage]
    L --> M[Alternative Polyadenylation]
    M --> J
    
    %% Regulation
    J --> N[Polyadenylation Status]
    N --> O{Polyadenylation Required?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Polyadenylation Activation]
    O -->|No| Q[Polyadenylation Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[CPSF] --> B
    S[Cleavage Factors] --> D
    T[PolyA Polymerase] --> F
    U[PABP] --> I
    V[Alternative PolyA Factors] --> L
    
